 "description": "The website/app Discover lineup, in its curated order: portraits, dated share links, category counts, starting-soon cards, performances, dining and tracked ticket actions. Defaults to Vegas today and rolls to tomorrow only when the unfiltered today feed is empty. Explicit dates stay fixed. Browse the next seven days. Cursor pages preserve one snapshot; after expiry restart without a cursor. For hard budget, party-age or arrival constraints use find_showtimes; this feed is not a family or availability filter.",
